---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/header/Header.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy";
const description =
  "Learn how GrailDaily collects, uses, and protects information when you visit our website.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p><strong>Last updated: September 19, 2026</strong></p>

      <p>
        GrailDaily ("we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy and is
        committed to being transparent about how information is collected and
        used when you visit our website.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <p>
        When you visit GrailDaily, certain information may be collected
        automatically through standard web technologies and analytics services.
        This may include information such as pages viewed, interactions with
        the website, approximate location derived from IP-related data,
        browser type, device information, referral information, and general
        usage patterns.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>

      <p>
        GrailDaily uses Google Analytics 4 ("Google Analytics") to understand
        how visitors use the website and to improve its content, functionality,
        and overall experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        Google Analytics may collect information about your visit, including
        page views, interactions, search activity, device and browser
        information, and related usage data. We use this information in
        aggregated or statistical form to understand website performance and
        audience behavior.
      </p>

      <p>
        Google processes information collected through Google Analytics in
        accordance with its own policies and terms. For more information,
        please review Google's privacy documentation.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

      <p>
        GrailDaily may use cookies and similar technologies through Google
        Analytics and other essential website functionality. These technologies
        may help distinguish sessions, understand website usage, and maintain
        the reliability of the website.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>

      <p>Information collected through the website may be used to:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Understand how visitors use GrailDaily.</li>
        <li>Measure website traffic and content engagement.</li>
        <li>Improve website content, navigation, and functionality.</li>
        <li>Monitor website performance and reliability.</li>
        <li>Maintain and improve the security of the website.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>

      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. Information may be processed
        by service providers that help us operate, maintain, analyze, or
        improve GrailDaily, including Google Analytics.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>

      <p>
        Analytics data may be retained according to the retention settings
        configured in Google Analytics and the policies of the relevant
        service provider.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Privacy Rights</h2>

      <p>
        Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights
        concerning your personal information, including rights to request
        information about its processing, access or correction of your
        information, request deletion where applicable, or exercise other
        rights provided by applicable privacy laws.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

      <p>
        GrailDaily may use third-party services to operate or analyze the
        website. Those services may process information according to their own
        privacy policies and terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

      <p>
        GrailDaily is not specifically directed toward children, and we do not
        knowingly collect personal information from children for the purpose of
        operating the website.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes
        to GrailDaily, the services we use, or applicable requirements. The
        updated version will be published on this page with a revised
        "Last updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how information is
        handled on GrailDaily, you can contact us through the contact method
        provided on the website.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>



